            "value": "عنوان API «%@» ليس عنوان URL صالحًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die API-Adresse „%@“ ist keine gültige URL."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API address “%@” isn't a valid URL."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The API address “%@” must use HTTPS. Plain HTTP is only allowed for localhost.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يجب أن يستخدم عنوان API «%@» بروتوكول HTTPS. لا يُسمح بـ HTTP غير المشفّر إلا لـ localhost."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die API-Adresse „%@“ muss HTTPS verwenden. Unverschlüsseltes HTTP ist nur für localhost erlaubt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The API address “%@” must use HTTPS. Plain HTTP is only allowed for localhost."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The action changed since you reviewed it. Review it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تغيّر الإجراء منذ أن راجعته. راجعه مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Aktion hat sich seit deiner Prüfung geändert. Prüfe sie erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The action changed since you reviewed it. Review it again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The approval expired": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انتهت صلاحية الموافقة"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Freigabe ist abgelaufen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The approval expired"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The booking was sent, but the site showed no confirmation. Check with the site before booking again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أُرسل الحجز، لكن الموقع لم يعرض تأكيدًا. تحقق من الموقع قبل الحجز مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Buchung wurde gesendet, aber die Website hat keine Bestätigung angezeigt. Prüf das auf der Website, bevor du noch einmal buchst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The booking was sent, but the site showed no confirmation. Check with the site before booking again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser agent isn't running on this server.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وكيل المتصفح لا يعمل على هذا الخادم."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Browser-Agent läuft auf diesem Server nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The browser agent isn't running on this server."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser stopped mid-way. If this step submits something, JARVIS can't tell whether it went through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "توقف المتصفح في منتصف الطريق. إذا كانت هذه الخطوة ترسل شيئًا، فلا يستطيع JARVIS معرفة ما إذا وصل."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Browser wurde mittendrin beendet. Wenn dieser Schritt etwas absendet, kann JARVIS nicht sagen, ob es angekommen ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The browser stopped mid-way. If this step submits something, JARVIS can't tell whether it went through."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The browser stopped unexpectedly.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "توقف المتصفح على نحو غير متوقع."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Browser hat unerwartet angehalten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The browser stopped unexpectedly."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection doesn't allow this yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يسمح الاتصال بهذا بعد."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung erlaubt das noch nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection doesn't allow this yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection it needs has expired. Reconnect it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انتهت صلاحية الاتصال المطلوب. أعد الاتصال."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die nötige Verbindung ist abgelaufen. Verbinde sie neu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection it needs has expired. Reconnect it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection stopped working or the thread is gone, so JARVIS stopped checking.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "توقف الاتصال عن العمل أو اختفت سلسلة الرسائل، لذا توقف JARVIS عن التحقق."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung funktioniert nicht mehr oder die Unterhaltung ist weg, daher prüft JARVIS nicht mehr."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection stopped working or the thread is gone, so JARVIS stopped checking."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection works again, so you can retry them now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "عاد الاتصال للعمل، فيمكنك إعادة محاولتها الآن."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Verbindung funktioniert wieder, du kannst sie jetzt wiederholen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The connection works again, so you can retry them now."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The email goes only to your own address.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُرسل الرسالة إلى عنوانك فقط."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die E-Mail geht nur an deine eigene Adresse."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The email goes only to your own address."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The event being cancelled": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الموعد الذي سيُلغى"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der abgesagte Termin"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The event being cancelled"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file is too large.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "الملف كبير جدًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Datei ist zu groß."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The file is too large."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The form receives": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يتلقى النموذج"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Formular erhält"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The form receives"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The last attempt may have worked": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ربما نجحت المحاولة الأخيرة"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der letzte Versuch war vielleicht erfolgreich"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last attempt may have worked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone couldn't be started. Close other apps that are recording and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر تشغيل الميكروفون. أغلق التطبيقات الأخرى التي تسجّل وحاول مرة أخرى."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Mikrofon konnte nicht gestartet werden. Schließe andere Apps, die aufnehmen, und versuche es erneut."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The microphone couldn't be started. Close other apps that are recording and try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most JARVIS may spend on purchases in a calendar month of your time zone. Orders being placed, placed, or with an unknown outcome count against it. Purchases in other currencies are refused, and every purchase still needs your approval of the exact items and total.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أقصى ما يمكن لـ JARVIS إنفاقه على المشتريات خلال شهر تقويمي بتوقيتك. تُحتسب ضمنه الطلبات قيد التقديم والمقدَّمة وتلك ذات النتيجة غير المعروفة. تُرفض المشتريات بعملات أخرى، وتظل كل عملية شراء بحاجة إلى موافقتك على المنتجات والمبلغ الإجمالي بدقة."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Höchstbetrag, den JARVIS in einem Kalendermonat deiner Zeitzone für Käufe ausgeben darf. Bestellungen, die gerade aufgegeben werden, aufgegeben sind oder deren Ausgang unbekannt ist, zählen dazu. Käufe in anderen Währungen werden abgelehnt, und jeder Kauf braucht weiterhin deine Freigabe der genauen Artikel und des Gesamtbetrags."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The most JARVIS may spend on purchases in a calendar month of your time zone. Orders being placed, placed, or with an unknown outcome count against it. Purchases in other currencies are refused, and every purchase still needs your approval of the exact items and total."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The name can be at most 120 characters long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يمكن أن يتجاوز طول الاسم 120 حرفًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Name darf höchstens 120 Zeichen lang sein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The name can be at most 120 characters long."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The offers are in different currencies. JARVIS doesn't convert them, because it has no exchange rate it can verify.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "العروض بعملات مختلفة. لا يحوّلها JARVIS لأنه لا يملك سعر صرف يمكنه التحقق منه."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Angebote sind in verschiedenen Währungen. JARVIS rechnet sie nicht um, weil es keinen Wechselkurs hat, den es überprüfen kann."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The offers are in different currencies. JARVIS doesn't convert them, because it has no exchange rate it can verify."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The order was interrupted while it was being placed. Check with the shop before ordering again; it counts against your monthly purchase limit until it's resolved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "انقطع الطلب أثناء تقديمه. تحقق من المتجر قبل الطلب مجددًا؛ ويُحتسب ضمن حدك الشهري للمشتريات إلى أن يُحسم."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Bestellung wurde beim Aufgeben unterbrochen. Prüf das beim Shop, bevor du noch einmal bestellst; bis es geklärt ist, zählt sie zu deinem monatlichen Kauflimit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The order was interrupted while it was being placed. Check with the shop before ordering again; it counts against your monthly purchase limit until it's resolved."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page looks different than expected, so JARVIS stopped rather than guess.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تبدو الصفحة مختلفة عمّا هو متوقع، لذا توقف JARVIS بدلًا من التخمين."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Seite sieht anders aus als erwartet, daher hat JARVIS abgebrochen statt zu raten."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The page looks different than expected, so JARVIS stopped rather than guess."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The price changed before the order was placed, so nothing was ordered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تغيّر السعر قبل تقديم الطلب، لذا لم يُطلب شيء."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Preis hat sich vor dem Aufgeben der Bestellung geändert, daher wurde nichts bestellt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The price changed before the order was placed, so nothing was ordered."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The price isn't in US dollars, the currency of your purchase limit.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "السعر ليس بالدولار الأمريكي، عملة حد مشترياتك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Preis ist nicht in US-Dollar, der Währung deines Kauflimits."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The price isn't in US dollars, the currency of your purchase limit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The request can be at most 4,000 characters long.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يمكن أن يتجاوز طول الطلب 4000 حرف."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Anfrage darf höchstens 4.000 Zeichen lang sein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The request can be at most 4,000 characters long."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result of an earlier task": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "نتيجة مهمة سابقة"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Ergebnis einer früheren Aufgabe"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The result of an earlier task"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The same request is still being processed. Wait a moment and refresh.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يزال الطلب نفسه قيد المعالجة. انتظر لحظة ثم حدّث."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dieselbe Anfrage wird noch bearbeitet. Warte einen Moment und aktualisiere."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The same request is still being processed. Wait a moment and refresh."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The schedule keeps this local time, also when the clocks change for daylight saving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يحافظ الجدول على هذا الوقت المحلي، حتى عند تغيير الساعة للتوقيت الصيفي."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Zeitplan behält diese Ortszeit bei, auch bei der Zeitumstellung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The schedule keeps this local time, also when the clocks change for daylight saving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The schedule was paused.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "كان الجدول متوقفًا مؤقتًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Zeitplan war pausiert."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The schedule was paused."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server sent a sign-in address this app won't open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أرسل الخادم عنوان تسجيل دخول لن يفتحه هذا التطبيق."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Server hat eine Anmeldeadresse gesendet, die diese App nicht öffnet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The server sent a sign-in address this app won't open."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shop doesn't state the total with shipping yet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لا يذكر المتجر بعد المبلغ الإجمالي شاملًا الشحن."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Shop nennt den Gesamtbetrag mit Versand noch nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The shop doesn't state the total with shipping yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in couldn't finish, so nothing was connected. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر إكمال تسجيل الدخول، لذا لم يُربط أي شيء. حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Anmeldung konnte nicht abgeschlossen werden, daher wurde nichts verbunden. Versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sign-in couldn't finish, so nothing was connected. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in returned an answer JARVIS can't use, so nothing was connected. Start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أعاد تسجيل الدخول ردًا لا يستطيع JARVIS استخدامه، لذا لم يُربط أي شيء. ابدأ من جديد."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Anmeldung hat eine Antwort geliefert, die JARVIS nicht verwenden kann, daher wurde nichts verbunden. Starte noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sign-in returned an answer JARVIS can't use, so nothing was connected. Start again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sign-in window couldn't open. Try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تعذّر فتح نافذة تسجيل الدخول. حاول مجددًا."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Anmeldefenster konnte nicht geöffnet werden. Versuche es noch einmal."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The sign-in window couldn't open. Try again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site asks to prove you're human. JARVIS never solves these.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
