            "value": "Write your answer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written by an AI model": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "كتبها نموذج ذكاء اصطناعي"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von einem KI-Modell geschrieben"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Written by an AI model"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written like a normal request, for example: Summarize https://example.com/news and email it to me. Each run is planned and checked when it happens; anything that needs your approval asks you then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "اكتبه كطلب عادي، مثلًا: لخّص https://example.com/news وأرسله لي بالبريد. يُخطَّط لكل تنفيذ ويُفحص عند حدوثه، وما يحتاج إلى موافقتك يسألك حينها."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie eine normale Anfrage formuliert, zum Beispiel: Fasse https://example.com/news zusammen und schick es mir per E-Mail. Jede Ausführung wird beim Start geplant und geprüft; was eine Freigabe braucht, fragt dich dann."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Written like a normal request, for example: Summarize https://example.com/news and email it to me. Each run is planned and checked when it happens; anything that needs your approval asks you then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "أنت"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You approved the action": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "وافقت على الإجراء"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast die Aktion freigegeben"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You approved the action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can allow it in Settings. You can always type your request instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمكنك السماح بذلك من الإعدادات. ويمكنك دائمًا كتابة طلبك بدلًا من ذلك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du kannst es in den Einstellungen erlauben. Du kannst deine Anfrage auch jederzeit tippen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can allow it in Settings. You can always type your request instead."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can follow up once the current request has finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمكنك المتابعة بعد انتهاء الطلب الحالي."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nachfragen ist möglich, sobald die aktuelle Anfrage abgeschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can follow up once the current request has finished."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can follow up once “%@” has finished.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "يمكنك المتابعة بعد انتهاء «%@»."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nachfragen ist möglich, sobald „%@“ abgeschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can follow up once “%@” has finished."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You declined the action": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "رفضت الإجراء"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast die Aktion abgelehnt"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You declined the action"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You don't have permission to do that.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ليس لديك إذن للقيام بذلك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dafür hast du keine Berechtigung."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You don't have permission to do that."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You sign in at %@ and confirm there. JARVIS never sees your password, and anything that writes or sends still waits for your approval.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تسجّل الدخول لدى %@ وتؤكد هناك. لا يرى JARVIS كلمة مرورك أبدًا، وكل ما يكتب أو يرسل يظل بانتظار موافقتك."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du meldest dich bei %@ an und bestätigst dort. JARVIS sieht dein Passwort nie, und alles, was schreibt oder sendet, wartet weiterhin auf deine Freigabe."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You sign in at %@ and confirm there. JARVIS never sees your password, and anything that writes or sends still waits for your approval."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You turned off external AI models, so JARVIS uses its offline rules engine for simple, well-defined requests.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "لقد أوقفت نماذج الذكاء الاصطناعي الخارجية، لذا يستخدم JARVIS محرّك القواعد دون اتصال للطلبات البسيطة والمحدّدة بوضوح."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du hast externe KI-Modelle ausgeschaltet, daher nutzt JARVIS für einfache, klar umrissene Anfragen seine Offline-Regel-Engine."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You turned off external AI models, so JARVIS uses its offline rules engine for simple, well-defined requests."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're offline. Check your connection and try again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
